NAME            HOST             DBNAME    USER      PASSWORD    TAGS                      DESC
prod-settle-ro  db.example.com   settledb  readonly  managed     prod,readonly,settlement  운영 DB 읽기 전용 (정산)
prod-settle-rw  db.example.com   settledb  writer    unmanaged   -                         운영 DB 쓰기
stg-settle      stg.example.com  settledb  app       unmanaged*  -                         -
dev-local       -                devdb     me        unmanaged*  dev                       -

* judged with environment variables or libpq defaults; see 'psql-manager show <name>'
